          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.6.1+1KI.6.2+1KI.6.3+1KI.6.4+1KI.6.5+1KI.6.6+1KI.6.7+1KI.6.8+1KI.6.9+1KI.6.10+1KI.6.11+1KI.6.12+1KI.6.13+1KI.6.14+1KI.6.15+1KI.6.16+1KI.6.17+1KI.6.18+1KI.6.19+1KI.6.20+1KI.6.21+1KI.6.22+1KI.6.23+1KI.6.24+1KI.6.25+1KI.6.26+1KI.6.27+1KI.6.28+1KI.6.29+1KI.6.30+1KI.6.31+1KI.6.32+1KI.6.33+1KI.6.34+1KI.6.35+1KI.6.36+1KI.6.37+1KI.6.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakam 6:1-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.3.1+2CH.3.2+2CH.3.3+2CH.3.4+2CH.3.5+2CH.3.6+2CH.3.7+2CH.3.8+2CH.3.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byok 3:1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki narozire, niyo Enju ya MUKAMA, ekaba ezitiriirweho eyehinguliriziibwe ekisiika, kandi omusaija ogu, akaba akwasire orubingo orw'okulengesa, orukaba niruhikya mita isatu. Yalenga ekisiika ekibaba nikihikya mita isatu oburaiha na mita isatu omukoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma yagenda ha irembo eriroleriire Burugaizooba yatemba amatembero gaalyo, yalenga ekiti ky'omulyango eky'irembo, oburaiha bwakyo obwa hansi, bwaba rubingo rumu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebisiika ebya hambaju obura orubingo rumu kandi orubingo rumu obugazi; omwanya ogwa hagati y'ebisiika ebya hambaju, mita ibiri n'ekicweka; kandi ekiti ky'omulyango ekya hairembo ekikaba kiri, hansi nambere kirukugarukira, orubingo rumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma yalenga ekisiika eky'irembo, kyahika mita munana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi emikumirro yakyo, mita emu; ekisiika eky'irembo, kikaba omunda, irembo nambere lirukugarukira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ha rubaju n'orubaju orw'irembo erya Burugaizooba, hakaba haroho ebisiika ebya ha rubaju bisatu; ebisiika ebi ebisatu, bikaba nibingana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma yalenga obugazi obw'omulyango ogw'irembo yaba mita mukaga n'ekicweka; kandi obw'irembo mita itano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omumaiso ag'ebisiika ez'ebisiika ebya ha rubaju, hambaju zombi, hakaba haroho ekisiika, ekirukuhika centimita makumi atano habuli rubaju. Kandi ebya hambaju, byahikyaga mita isatu orubaju n'orubaju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma, yalenga irembo, okutandikira enyuma y'ekisiika ekimu ekya ha rubaju okugarukira enyuma ey'ekisiika ekindi, omwanya ogwamita makumi abiri n'ekicweka, okuruga harwigi orumu okuhika ha rundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yalenga n'omulyango, gwahika mita ikumi; kandi enyuma y'omulyango ogw'irembo eri, nuho hakaba hali ezigati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuruga omumaiso g'irembo erya ha mulyango, okuhika ha kisiika eky'omunda eky'irembo, hakaba nihahika mita abiri na itano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi irembo likaba lyehinguliriziibwe amadirisa agafunzire omunda, nigataaha omu mikumirro yago, omu bisiika ebya harubaja, ekisasi nakyo, kikaba kiina amadirisa omunda agakyehinguliriize, kandi ha mikumirro, hakaba haroho emikindo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma yantwara omuzigati ey'aheeru; hakaba haroho ebisiika amakumi asatu ebikaba byombekerwe haihi n'ekisiika eky'aheeru, kandi omumaiso g'ebisiika ebi, hakaba haroho ekiikaro ekinyakwalirirwe n'amabaale, kigalihire, kimazireyo ezigati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiikaro eki ekikaba kyalirirwe, kikagenda ha rubaju rw'amalembo, kyainganaingana n'obura bwago; eki nikyo ekicweka ha nsi ekyayaliirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma yalenga omwanya okuruga ha kicweka eky'omumaiso eky'omunda, okugarukira ha ky'omumaiso eky'aheeru eky'ezigati ey'omunda, mita makumi atano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma yanyebembera, yatoma ha bukiizi obw'emoso, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oku hakaba haliyo irembo ery'ezigati, ey'aheeru, erikaba liroleriire habukiizi obw'emoso. Yalenga obura n'obugazi bwalyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebisiika byalyo ebya ha rubaju, orubaju n'orubaju emikumirro n'ekisasi bikaba nibingana na biri eby'irembo ery'okubanza; obura bwalyo mita abiri na itano kandi obugazi ikumi na ibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadirisa gaalyo, ekisasi kyalyo, n'emikindo yalyo, bikaba nibingana na biri eby'irembo eryarolerraga Burugaizooba; hakaba haroho amatembero musanju, agaatwaraga ha irembo eri; kandi ekisasi kikaba kiri ha rubaju orw'omunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omumaiso g'irembo erya ha bukiizi obw'emoso, nka Burugaizooba, hakaba haliyo irembo erirukutwara omu zigati ey'omunda; yalenga omwanya oguli hagati y'irembo okuhika ha lindi, gwahika mita makumi atano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
