        },
        {
          "text": "Ekisasi kyalyo kikaba kiroleriire ezigati ey'aheeru, liroho emikindo ha mikumirro yalyo n'orubaju; omuhanda ogwatwarayoga, gukaba guroho amatembero munaana.",
