              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakaba haroho ekisiika, kiina orwigi rurorraine n'omukumirro gw'irembo, eki nikyo kyayogezebwamuga ekihongwa eky'okwokya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omu kisasi eky'irembo hakaba haroho emeeza ibiri orubaju n'orubaju, ezaitirwahoga ekihongwa; eky'okwokya, eky'okuganyiza ebibi, n'eky'okuganyiza omusango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aheeru y'ekisasi, ha mulyango ogw'irembo erya ha mukono ogw'obumoso, hakaba haroho emeeza ibiri; ha rubaju orundi orw'ekisasi, naho hakaba haroho emeeza ibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emeeza ina zikaba ziri ha rubaju orw'omunda, kandi ina zindi, zikaba ziri ha rubaju orw'aheeru orw'orubaju orw'irembo, emeeza munaana zikaba ziri z'okusarraho ebyonzira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakaba haroho n'emeeza ina ezindi, ezibaizirwe omu mabaale ez'ekihongwa eky'okwokya, obura bwazo centimita makumi atano, obugazi omukono gumu, obwemi centimita nsanju na itano, ezi nizo zaateebwahoga ebintu eby'okwisa ebihongwa eby'okwokya, n'ebyonzira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunda hakahanikwamu ebikwaso ebirukwingana mirimita nsanju na itano emeeza ezi, nizo zaateebwahoga enyama ey'ekihongwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
